From: Erfan Abdi <erfangplus@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/25] apklayer: so-max-512

SO_MAX 128 -> 512: Android's libandroid_runtime closure is 237 libraries (the soinfo pool was 128)

apklayer patch: step 1 of the former scripts/patch-bionic-translation.sh (see docs/PATCHES.md), patch 0001 of patches/bionic_translation.
---
 linker/linker.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/linker/linker.c b/linker/linker.c
index 7824cc1..5d8f4fe 100644
--- a/linker/linker.c
+++ b/linker/linker.c
@@ -80,7 +80,7 @@
 #include "linker_sleb128.h"
 
 #define ALLOW_SYMBOLS_FROM_MAIN 1
-#define SO_MAX 128
+#define SO_MAX 512
 
 /* Assume average path length of 64 and max 8 paths */
 #define LDPATH_BUFSIZE	  512
